      "text": "`main` calls `entity_texts` before `snapshot_keys`, so a run interrupted before `snapshot_files.jsonl` is published raises `FileNotFoundError` before the report can explain how to recover. Fix: Call `snapshot_keys` before reading entity texts and test a snapshot directory with neither row file."
